# Silence known, harmless warnings for everyday use (`make sim`).
# `make sim-debug` skips this file and shows everything.

# The pads' LED data goes out on SPI1, which has no model connected yet.
logLevel 3 spi1
# SPI2 raises DMA requests after channel 5 has already copied the whole
# framebuffer (Renode copies memory-to-peripheral blocks at once).
logLevel 3 dma1
# Unmodelled registers (FLASH, ADC...): thousands of accesses at boot.
logLevel 3 sysbus
